sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / SDK
    participant MLPipeline as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8443/8887/8888 TCP
    participant TokenReview as Kubernetes TokenReview<br/>authentication/v1
    participant SAR as Kubernetes SubjectAccessReview<br/>authorization/v1
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>(SeaweedFS/MinIO)
    participant ArgoWF as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant PersistAgent as Persistence Agent
    participant MetaWriter as Metadata Writer
    participant MetaEnvoy as Metadata Envoy<br/>9090/TCP
    participant MetaGRPC as Metadata gRPC Store<br/>8080/TCP
    participant CacheWH as Cache Server<br/>Mutating Webhook<br/>443/TCP

    Note over Client, MLPipeline: API Request Flow

    Client->>MLPipeline: gRPC/REST Request<br/>Bearer Token in header
    MLPipeline->>TokenReview: POST TokenReview<br/>Validate bearer token
    TokenReview-->>MLPipeline: TokenReview Response<br/>(authenticated user info)
    MLPipeline->>SAR: POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>Check resource permissions
    SAR-->>MLPipeline: SAR Response<br/>(allowed/denied)
    MLPipeline->>MySQL: Query pipeline metadata<br/>3306/TCP
    MySQL-->>MLPipeline: Query results
    MLPipeline-->>Client: API Response

    Note over Client, S3: Pipeline Upload Flow

    Client->>MLPipeline: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Pipeline YAML/IR
    MLPipeline->>TokenReview: Validate token
    TokenReview-->>MLPipeline: Authenticated
    MLPipeline->>SAR: Check create permission
    SAR-->>MLPipeline: Allowed
    MLPipeline->>S3: Store pipeline artifact<br/>AWS SDK v2 (path-style)
    S3-->>MLPipeline: Upload confirmed
    MLPipeline->>MySQL: Store pipeline record
    MySQL-->>MLPipeline: Stored
    MLPipeline-->>Client: Pipeline created

    Note over ArgoWF, MetaGRPC: Pipeline Execution Flow

    ArgoWF->>ArgoWF: Execute workflow steps
    ArgoWF->>CacheWH: Pod creation intercepted<br/>Mutating admission webhook
    CacheWH-->>ArgoWF: Cache hit: skip step<br/>Cache miss: proceed

    PersistAgent->>ArgoWF: Watch workflow status
    ArgoWF-->>PersistAgent: Workflow state updates
    PersistAgent->>MLPipeline: Sync run status<br/>(report API)

    MetaWriter->>ArgoWF: Watch workflow resources
    ArgoWF-->>MetaWriter: Execution artifacts
    MetaWriter->>MetaEnvoy: Write execution metadata<br/>9090/TCP
    MetaEnvoy->>MetaGRPC: Proxy gRPC request<br/>8080/TCP
    MetaGRPC-->>MetaEnvoy: Stored
    MetaEnvoy-->>MetaWriter: Confirmed
